From: EMERALD project
Subject: [PATCH] Enable pret BUGFIX baseline for corrected builds

This patch is intended for pret/pokeemerald commit
5eff78649e7170a877b961ef0b3da13b81a16038.

Enabling BUGFIX also enables UBFIX through include/config.h, so the corrected
build takes both the ordinary identified bug-fix paths and the genuine
undefined-behavior fixes instead of retail-compatible buggy branches.

---
 include/config.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/include/config.h b/include/config.h
--- a/include/config.h
+++ b/include/config.h
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@
 #endif
 
 // Uncomment to fix some identified minor bugs
-//#define BUGFIX
+#define BUGFIX
 
 // Various undefined behavior bugs may or may not prevent compilation with
 // newer compilers. So always fix them when using a modern compiler.
